 ### Fixed
 
+- Attachment preparation reports `attachment_original_budget` for images over 10 MiB before conversion ([WebUI #38](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/38)).
+
 - Protected input retained in native queues after plain abort no longer receives premature terminal no-input completion; actual original-object withdrawal or consumption rechecks its receipt ([WebUI #36](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/36)).
 
 - Permanently withdrawn queued originals retain explicit no-entry provenance, including pre-delivery and held objects, without treating temporary moves or retained abort input as discarded ([WebUI #36](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/36)).
